      "text": "Quantum hyperbolic geometry — 25 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Universal QHG\n\n**Quantum hyperbolic geometry**\n\n*STEPHANE BASEILHAC*\n\n73 pp, 25 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Universal QHG; 2.1 Building blocks; 2.2 QHG triangulated pseudomanifolds; 2.3 QHG universal functor; 2.4 Towards geometric specializations; 3 Parameters for PSL(2,C)-characters of surfac; 3.1 Efficient triangulations; 3.2 Cocycle parameters; 3.3 Cross-ratio parameters; 4 The QHFT bordism category; 4.1 Marked topological bordisms; 4.2 Boundary structures; 5 The QHFT functor; 5.1 From QHFT bordisms to QHG-triangulated pse; 5.2 Amplitudes; 5.3 QHFT variants",
